}</pre></section></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div>Cancel this campaign?</div><div><span class="block">We&#x27;ll stop sending to remaining recipients. <strong>Already-sent emails cannot be recalled.</strong> 2 of 3 emails have been sent so far.</span></div></div><div><button variant="outline">Keep sending</button><button variant="destructive">Cancel campaign</button></div></div></div>"
`;
